Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ASTERG
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Experimental ANDEIVA boot theme resources
 GRUB and Plymouth theme data for a separately qualified Debian installation.
 This package does not select a theme, install Plymouth, rebuild an initramfs,
 update GRUB, change boot arguments, or configure services.
